 R←Test_Dir2_036(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;path;list;list2
⍝ Test the `Dir2` method recursively on a tree that contains at least one folder with right limitations
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 :If 'Win'≢APLTreeUtils2.GetOperatingSystem ⍬
     R←T._WindowsOnly
 :Else
     path←(WinSys.ExpandEnv'%SYSTEMROOT%'),'\system32\*'
     list←⊃('recurse' 2)##.FilesAndDirs.Dir2 path
     list←⎕C list
     list←list[⍋list]

     list2←⊃(0)⎕NINFO⍠('Recurse' 2)('Wildcard' 1)⊣path
     list2←##.FilesAndDirs.NormalizePath list2
     list2←⎕C list2
     list2←list2[⍋list2]

     →T.PassesIf list≡list2

     R←T._OK
 :EndIf
